{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-js","path":"/pensieve/wordpress-publish-error","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"html":"<h2>Problem</h2>\n<p>Recently while working on a WordPress project with <a href=\"https://github.com/Upstatement/ups-dock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Ups Dock</a>, I encountered a weird error where I wasn't able to update or publish a simple post in my local WP admin.</p>\n<p>It looked something like this:</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 1200px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 32.33333333333333%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Draft fail\"\n        title=\"Draft fail\"\n        src=\"/Portfolio/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/e027d/draft-fail.png\"\n        srcset=\"/Portfolio/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/617d2/draft-fail.png 300w,\n/Portfolio/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/d4eb7/draft-fail.png 600w,\n/Portfolio/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/e027d/draft-fail.png 1200w,\n/Portfolio/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/13949/draft-fail.png 1800w,\n/Portfolio/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/2a19b/draft-fail.png 2234w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<p>Sometimes the error message would be slightly more helpful: <code class=\"language-text\">Publishing failed. Error message: The response is not a valid JSON response.</code></p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 956px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 11.666666666666666%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABQAAAACCAIAAADXZGvcAAAACXBIWXMAAAsTAAALEwEAmpwYAAAAU0lEQVQI113LQQ6AIAwEQP7/O1u6W8MRFEriH9SQePA6yaRwryKn4TQb4CA70FSne5BHzt0s6NP3DnSzV4CqepWSVm6avzzIukmQQV/+z4Yq8uQbiGdm6Od9qWQAAAAASUVORK5CYII='); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Publish error\"\n        title=\"Publish error\"\n        src=\"/Portfolio/static/ac418cb7402b96be332b88c4505db1b1/2d084/publish-error.png\"\n        srcset=\"/Portfolio/static/ac418cb7402b96be332b88c4505db1b1/617d2/publish-error.png 300w,\n/Portfolio/static/ac418cb7402b96be332b88c4505db1b1/d4eb7/publish-error.png 600w,\n/Portfolio/static/ac418cb7402b96be332b88c4505db1b1/2d084/publish-error.png 956w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 956px) 100vw, 956px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<p>And if I popped open the console, I saw these errors:</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 1185px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 20.666666666666668%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Console errors\"\n        title=\"Console errors\"\n        src=\"/Portfolio/static/d342131a17d748d605395cbdcc072a7f/11a26/console-errors.png\"\n        srcset=\"/Portfolio/static/d342131a17d748d605395cbdcc072a7f/617d2/console-errors.png 300w,\n/Portfolio/static/d342131a17d748d605395cbdcc072a7f/d4eb7/console-errors.png 600w,\n/Portfolio/static/d342131a17d748d605395cbdcc072a7f/11a26/console-errors.png 1185w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 1185px) 100vw, 1185px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<h2>Solution</h2>\n<p>Since the error message had to do with a JSON response, I initially thought it was a Gutenberg or ACF issue. But it turned out this was happening because I was on the https WP admin (i.e. <a href=\"https://project.ups.dock/wp-admin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://project.ups.dock/wp-admin</a>), not the unsecure WP admin (<a href=\"http://project.ups.dock/wp-admin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">http://project.ups.dock/wp-admin</a>).</p>\n<p>It was a CORS error!! I was trying to modify a non-https domain from a https domain. Switching to a non-https WP admin allowed me to publish posts with no problem.</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"WordPress Publishing Error","description":"Trying to create a simple post in WordPress","date":"2019-12-03T00:00:00.000Z","slug":"/pensieve/wordpress-publish-error","tags":["WordPress"]}}},"pageContext":{"language":"en","intl":{"language":"en","languages":["en","pt"],"messages":{"about":"About","experience":"Experience","education":"Education","projects":"Projects","contact":"Contact","resume_button":"Resume","hero_greeting":"Hi, my name is","hero_name":"Igor Fernando Casita.","hero_subtitle":"Junior Full-Stack Software Developer.","hero_description":"I’m a junior software developer focused on full-stack development and RESTful APIs. I have hands-on experience building real-world systems using {java}, {node}, and {python}, working with {postgres}, {docker}, and well-documented APIs using {swagger}. And on frontend, I do build systems using {react}.{br}{br}Currently pursuing an interdisciplinary Bachelor’s degree in Science and Technology at {ufabc}, with a planned academic progression to Computer Science.","about_heading":"About Me","about_p1":"Hello! My name is Igor, and I’m a junior software developer with a strong focus on backend development and building real-world systems. My interest in software development started back in 2019 when I decided to try creating games — after a few tutorials, I quickly realized that I enjoyed the problem-solving aspect of programming much more than the actual game design. Since then, I have been passionate about learning various programming languages and frameworks, particularly in backend technologies like Java (Spring Boot), Node.js (Express), and Python (Django).","about_p2":"Fast-forward to today, and I’ve had the privilege of working as a volunteer at","about_p2_link":"a CPS school","about_p2_end":"My main focus these days is learning microservices architecture and cloud computing platforms like AWS.","about_p3":"Here are a few technologies I’ve been working with recently:","experience_heading":"Professional Experience","academic_featured_heading":"Academic Journey","academic_grid_heading":"Professional Certifications","academic_courses_heading":"Relevant Coursework","academic_languages_heading":"Languages","academic_languages_loading":"Loading globe...","academic_languages_form":"Form Globe","academic_languages_unroll":"Unroll Map","academic_languages_reset":"Reset","academic_languages_portuguese":"Portuguese","academic_languages_portuguese_level":"Native","academic_languages_english":"English","academic_languages_english_level":"Advanced - B2","academic_languages_spanish":"Spanish","academic_languages_spanish_level":"Intermediate - B1","academic_languages_chinese":"Chinese (Mandarin)","academic_languages_chinese_level":"Basic - A2","academic_languages_france":"French","academic_languages_france_level":"Basic - A2","academic_languages_certification":"View Certification","featured_cta":"Learn more","featured_overline":"Featured Projects","projects_heading":"Projects","projects_h2":"Other Noteworthy Projects","projects_archive":"view the archive","projects_show":"Show","projects_show_more":"More","projects_show_less":"Less","contact_overline":"What’s Next?","contact_title":"Get In Touch","contact_description":"I’m a Junior Full Stack Developer with hands-on experience building real-world web and mobile applications using React, Node.js, and Spring Boot. I’m currently open to junior opportunities, internships, freelance projects, and technical collaborations. If you’re looking for someone who values clean code, solid architecture, and continuous learning, feel free to reach out — I’d be glad to connect.","contact_button":"Say Hello","footer_rights":"Designed & Built by Igor Fernando Casita"},"routed":false,"originalPath":"/pensieve/wordpress-publish-error","redirect":true,"defaultLanguage":"en"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1127135046","1921109229","1994492073","2596216473","3208555609","3825832676","3933733069"]}